{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120514","id":3906565763,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7o2XaD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120514","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120514.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120514.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120514","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120514/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120514/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120514/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2cfdd431b1d43bcd7f4bbbb6e7f714b622f0d0ab","number":120514,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add multi-selection and copy options to the debugger Errors panel","user":{"login":"LMBooth","id":31129153,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMTI5MTUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31129153?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth","html_url":"https://github.com/LMBooth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LMBooth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Multi-selection and copy options for the debugger Errors panel\n\nPreviously the **Debugger → Errors** panel only allowed selecting and copying a single error at a time. This makes it easier to grab debugger output for bug reports and logs.\n\n### Changes\n- **Multi-selection** — the errors tree switches from `SELECT_ROW` to `SELECT_MULTI`, so errors/warnings can be selected with `Shift`-click (range) and `Ctrl`-click (toggle). Click-to-navigate is preserved by listening to `cell_selected` (emitted in `SELECT_MULTI`) instead of `item_selected`.\n- **\"Copy All\" toolbar button** — copies every error/warning, enabled/disabled in lockstep with the existing Expand/Collapse/Clear buttons.\n- **Right-click \"Copy Message Only\"** — copies just the summary line(s), alongside the existing **\"Copy Error\"** which keeps the full detail (C++ source + stack trace). *Open C++ Source on GitHub* is shown only when a single error is selected.\n- **`Ctrl+C`** copies the current selection (detailed).\n\nCopying handles multiple selected errors, de-duplicates by parent error, and preserves panel order. The original single-item copy formatting is refactored into shared `_format_error()` / `_copy_errors()` helpers, so single-error copies are byte-for-byte unchanged.\n\n### Notes\n- `SELECT_MULTI` highlights the selected cell rather than the whole row (Godot's `Tree` has no multi-row mode); copy maps any selected cell back to its parent error, so this is purely cosmetic.\n\n### Related\n- Proposal: godotengine/godot-proposals#15049\n- godotengine/godot-proposals#12657 (Stack Trace panel)\n- godotengine/godot-proposals#5233 (copy message without extra detail)\n\n### Testing\nBuilt locally (`scons platform=windows target=editor`). Ran a project that emits errors/warnings, then verified: Shift/Ctrl multi-select, Ctrl+C, right-click Copy Error / Copy Message Only on a multi-selection, and the Copy All button.\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived",